script KiposTown_Zoo_EnvironmentSign_Volcano
{
    lock
    msgbox(format("Enclosure No. 11: {COLOR GREEN}Volcano{COLOR DARK_GRAY}\p Combining the rugged terrain of traditional mountain ecosystems with the scorching heat of lava, volcanoes are only for the toughest of Pokémon. Although they are associated with destruction, volcanoes are just as important in creation. For example, many islands in the Ilios Region were first formed by volcanoes!\p Most Pokémon species found here are {COLOR GREEN}Fire-type{COLOR DARK_GRAY}, helping them withstand the intense heat. Some {COLOR GREEN}Poison and Rock-type{COLOR DARK_GRAY} Pokémon can also survive here."))
    closemessage
    release
    end
}

